    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basaaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sisiina mureeda sheeda siguura Abibu, ak gisisi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ghweelmeeda Basaaka, aba gideaba sheeda Abibu gooruunaneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ng'eanyiida Misri eawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajadawa lukghumajeega NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, aba jeeda gisilgaagu ghana jeeda dugwaagu, gaysisiina heeda jea ghoahiimu NG'UTAMIIDA, jea gamiindeaysa gheawungaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giyeaguudayi sea mukaateeda siimatawiidi; eawooji ispwa gajagudayeewana mukaateeda meamwatawiida, mukaateeda hang'weanidooda aba gideaba girini ng'eanyiida Misri nea gilamwajaani, hean abeeda aba jeeda eaweagaagu gajapkaada eaweeda irini jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu geedeaksa headaang'u matawanda aba jeeda ng'eanyiidaang'u sean, aba eawooji ispwa; ghana banyeega lukghumajeega ijeanyi shing'ada eaweeda madeeda adiidu gwalil eawa ea gamuchu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giidaydi lukghumajeega aba jeesinga mujiinajeagaagu goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geaghus heeda jea ghwaloat NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, jea gamiindeaysa gheawungaaschi; gajadaydeaysiina hoowa lukghumajeega Basaaka, shing'ada damanda mikteawa aseeta, damanda ghayi irini ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajawala ak giyeaksi heeda jea ghoahiimu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U; ama iimuchu sakteayda gay yamwa geaw biikta jeeda maheemajeagaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajaga mukaatajeega meematawiita eawooji lah, eaweeteaba ispwa gaygwanda badoodeaba geat ghaydit heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U; adiidu gigadiiyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmeeda lajita booga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iita wiikaji ispwa; ang'eada iitooda wiikaji ispwa damanda madeeda iing'eadi lajita booga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda gaysina ghweelmeeda wiikajeega NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U aba haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi simwas bea ghadooweeda bea geatingaagu, jea adayda aba gida goondaneey ghawooda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayhoosana aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ang'iing'i ea orjeedang'u ea hudaang'u, ea soomjeandaang'u was ng'eedeeda ea dea was gatmooda, ea siida eemeeda Lawi abiita mujiineadaang'u, ea rabascheanda, ea bananeeda ea masinung'weanda mida headaang'u, aba heeda jea ghwaloat NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, heeda jea gamiindeaysa gheawungaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajapkaada gideaba ghayi guwoosi soomjooga aba ng'eanyiida Misri; ak gaysina badiida aba giing'ooydeaba diigheanyeeksu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmeeda udahabeaschajeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sina ghweelmeeda udahabeaschajeega aba eawooji ispwa, nea niimughuushi boagaagu ea difaayeadaang'u imwanmwani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayhoosasiina ghweelmeadaang'u, ang'iing'i ea orjeedang'u ea hudaang'u, ea soomjeandaang'u was ng'eedeeda ea dea was gatmooda, ea siida eemeeda Lawi, ea rabascheanda, ea bananeeda ea masinung'weanda mida jeeda mujiinajeagaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisiina NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ghweelmeeda aba eawooji ispwa, aba heeda jea ghwaloat niny; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygagoonyi ghawooda aba gilinyoo laja eara aba gadiyoojiga geatingaagu, ak gaybeaha hooseaneega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Niba samwagu aba jeeda gweayda gayghapka headiga sean madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U was heeda jea ghwaloat niny, aba ghweelmeeda mukaatajeega meematawiita ea ghweelmeeda lajita booga ea ghweelmeeda udahabeaschajeega. Adiidu ghapka madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA nea ghaghus geatinga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gilinyoo ea siida gil, gayghoadayda aba gida amuusta deena ghawooda goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gheambalmeeda doabiiwaat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaygwalni fuga aheeldooschi buuneeda ea shirikarajeega hees aba jeeda mujiinajeagaagu goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, aba giteena eemoojigaagu; ak gaygwalaja girgweaguutka buuneeda nea ghoadoabiiw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gighwani huumeanda doabiiwaat, adiidu gisini shiitmeeda; nea adigeandi haleanjeeda seawshooda, aba gideaba seawshooda iissa gwadukuta gheanyanga siida bwaraawu ak ghwayam girgweageeda fuga doobiiweadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aada geeshta huumeanda, ak abeeda gaynyasa eaweega ak gihearani ng'eanyiida goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu ging'aapti geeta wassean uurji aseecheeka sigadoowani siguura Ashera aba murdeeda heeda wagiida jea sina bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea adiidu gimiindi daraneeda, mabwariinya NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
